```javascript
import { h, app } from 'hyperapp';
import 'normalize.css';
import 'typeface-varela-round';
import './index.css';
```

This works fine when running `parcel index.html` but it does not work using `parcel build index.html`
Somehow, the typeface file gets omitted. The only way it'll work is if I manually copy the @font-face declaration to another css file that already contains some other css.

