Well it basically is the options that are passed to cssnano, it's being handled by parcel and passed as the options object.

A random example taken from the cssnano website `cssnano.config.js`:
```Javascript
module.exports = {
  preset: ['default', {
    discardComments: {
      removeAll: true,
    },
  }]
};
```
And Parcel handles it like this:
https://github.com/parcel-bundler/parcel/blob/9eac73e21dba7dfdf4d408902e206d76364ba9af/src/transforms/postcss.js#L54
